      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "In pursuit of the mysterious vessel heard in the dead of night, I found myself delving into a series of cramped and salty galley spaces beneath the deck. One such area led to a cistern, a cold and damp chamber containing a tin cup. Despite my initial intentions, I did not find the source of the strange noises, nor did I locate the vessel itself. However, the journey provided a glimpse into the hidden workings of the ship, revealing the hard work and persistence of those who toil unseen to keep the vessel afloat.",
